Sval: show a prompt in a modal box as Sval's prompt page

A page's alert, confirm and prompt, a site's sign-in and the question
before a page is left all open toolkit's common dialog in a tab's or a
window's modal box. Sval draws every dialog as its own card, so both
openers load Sval's prompt page there, which drives the common dialog's
own CommonDialog and answers through the same property bag. A prompt
with no box keeps the common dialog's window.

